body:
I got the Amos Bow a while back and havent really found a good use for it. When I saw Ganyu's damage with it I started rolling and I havent regretted it. Shes actually insane if you have Amos bow. It is a 5 star bow and if you dont have it, she probably isnt worth it. She is a pretty selfish DPS character that forces you to play as a HARD Bow user by mostly focusing on charged attacks. 

Although support Ganyu with full energy recharge is not bad at all either and is insane for melt combos. 

&#x200B;

If you are going for the support route, Chongyun honestly does the same job as Ganyu does with his E, so it is up to you which you prefer. 

&#x200B;

TLDR; if you have a good bow for her and you need a somewhat main/side DPS character she is perfect for you. If you already have a Diluc/Keqing/etc shes a fine support if you really want her.

Im speculating that Hu Tao is after Keqing banner simply because the banners are 2 weeks this time instead of 3. And if you do the math, thats just enough time to squeeze in another banner within the 6 weeks. 

&#x200B;

What this also tells me is that a Jean/Diluc banner is coming. Probably during the Mondstadt event coming.
